						<r3d:remarks>PISCO is covered by Thomson Reuters Data Citation Index. Partnership for Interdisciplinary Studies of Coastal Oceans (PISCO) activities are funded through a diversity of collaborative grants from public and private sources. PISCO is a DataOne member node: https://search.dataone.org/portals/PISCO
When PISCO scientists collect data as part of projects funded by the National Science Foundation Division of Ocean Sciences, data are archived with the Foundation&#039;s Biological and Chemical Oceanography Data Management Office. These data include pH from sensors mounted in the rocky intertidal and on nearshore coastal moorings, organism responses to ocean acidification, and ecological data relevant to rockfish and seastar populations. Links to project descriptions, data, and metadata: https://www.bco-dmo.org/program/2033</r3d:remarks>
